LineageOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/LineageOS, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LineageOS trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init --depth=1 --no-repo-verify -u https://github.com/doubledashdot/android.git -b lineage-20.0 --git-lfs -g default,-mips,-darwin,-notdefault
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync -c -j24 --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags --optimized-fetch --prune
```
Please see the [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for building instructions, by device.
